The CHGame adaptation replaces Arduboy hardware services, EEPROM and AVR
pointer handling, adds native pause/mute controls, expands the scrolling
viewport to 128x128, and corrects fixed-width arithmetic and the all-coins
badge total. Original game artwork, 39-level order, physics, enemies and
scoring are retained.
